  "description": "A launcher sits at the left end of a flat 70 m field marked every 10 m. A red target disk with a flag sits down the field. Set the launch angle (the barrel tilts) and speed, then press Launch: an orange ball flies its arc, leaving a trail; your previous arc stays as a faded line. Readouts give landing distance, miss distance and side, flight time, highest point, launches used and targets hit. Hit targets at 30 m, 45 m and 18 m within 10 launches.",
